#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/whatsapp_conversation_extension/models/discuss_channel.py:0
msgid ""
"You do not have permission to manage the members of this WhatsApp "
"conversation. You must belong to the \"WhatsApp Channel Member Manager\" "
"group and be assigned as a manager for this channel."
msgstr ""
"No tienes permiso para gestionar los miembros de esta conversación de WhatsApp. Debes pertenecer al grupo \"Gestor de miembros del canal de WhatsApp\" y estar asignado como gestor de este canal."
